. . Bharat and Shatrughan will die! ''

455
00:52:42,887 --> 00:52:46,562
''Laxman ! At times, anger
leads to regret! ''

456
00:52:47,007 --> 00:52:50,443
Lord Rama. .

457
00:52:52,087 --> 00:52:53,156
Rama. .

458
00:52:54,047 --> 00:52:55,116
Bharat!

459
00:53:10,287 --> 00:53:12,357
O'' brother. .
- Bharat!

460
00:53:21,287 --> 00:53:25,724
Bharat. .
- Dear Rama. .

461
00:53:38,647 --> 00:53:42,356
''Had l not been born, you wouldn''t
be in exile like this. ''

462
00:53:42,727 --> 00:53:48,245
lt''s all God''s will. - But there''s
a stigma against my name

463
