You''re wrong. Your name will
mean love and sacrifice

464
00:53:54,801 --> 00:53:55,870
Dear brother. .

465
00:54:04,721 --> 00:54:05,790
O'' ocean of mercy

466
00:54:09,481 --> 00:54:15,113
''- Sita ! Accept my respects.
- Be happy, Bharat''

467
00:54:15,801 --> 00:54:16,950
Laxman !

468
00:54:19,481 --> 00:54:20,880
Brother Bharat!
- Laxman. .

469
00:54:22,241 --> 00:54:26,757
You''re very lucky to be in
