496
00:56:43,904 --> 00:56:46,259
- Give these my Lord - lf
that''s what you want. .

497
00:56:46,344 --> 00:56:48,733
. .then, take them''

498
00:57:08,384 --> 00:57:15,540
''Raghupati Raghav, O King Rama,
Holy couple, Sita-Rama''

499
00:57:15,624 --> 00:57:20,778
Long live Lord Rama

500
00:58:42,944 --> 00:58:47,335
''lt''s not every day that a
cuckoo calls in the garden''

501
00:58:51,704 --> 00:58:55,140
One doesn''t repeat one''s mistake

502
00:58:56,304 --> 00:59:00,422
''Spring too comes once
in a while. . .

503
00:59:00,504 --> 00:59:04,782
. .Just as a flower blooms but once''

504
00:59:04,864 --> 00:59:09,016
. .Just as a flower blooms but once''

505
00:59:28,224 --> 00:59:32,342
''These unruly tresses. .
set aside your veil''

506
00:59:32,624 --> 00:59:36,742
''They kiss the beauty of your face''

507
00:59:41,544 --> 00:59:49,861
''This sensuous cool breeze. .
come closer to me''

508
00:59:50,384 --> 00:59:54,297
''lt says, love me. Don''t
go away from me''

509
00:59:58,664 --> 01:00:04,022
So come, let''s love''

510
01:00:04,104 --> 01:00:08,222
''lt''s not every day that a
cuckoo sings in the garden''

511
01:00:22,864 --> 01:00:26,937
''My eyes full of mischief,
lined with kohl''

512
01:00:27,345 --> 01:00:31,338
''They flirt with an
ascetic on the sly''

513
01:00:35,985 --> 01:00:38,453
The buds beautify their faces. .

514
01:00:42,345 --> 01:00:44,461
and love tinkles the anklets

515
01:00:44,705 --> 01:00:48,698
''My heart dances with joy.
And l lose all my senses''

516
01:00:53,185 --> 01:00:58,259
So come, let''s fall in love''

517
01:00:58,345 --> 01:01:02,338
''lt''s not every day that a
cuckoo calls in the garden''

518
01:01:02,865 --> 01:01:05,743
''One also doesn''t repeat
one''s mistake''

519
01:01:06,785 --> 01:01:10,460
''Spring too comes
once in a while. .

520
01:01:10,585 --> 01:01:15,295
. .Just as a flower blooms,
just once''

521
01:01:19,665 --> 01:01:23,658
''lt''s not every day that the
cuckoo sings in the garden''

522
01:01:29,697 --> 01:01:32,006
''Be frank, Madam.
What do you want?''

523
01:01:33,217 --> 01:01:34,366
You

524
