01:07:40,095 --> 01:07:43,132
You''ll remain safe behind
this line drawn by me

587
01:08:23,136 --> 01:08:25,809
Alms to the poor

588
01:08:28,496 --> 01:08:29,929
Alms to the poor

589
01:08:39,816 --> 01:08:42,694
''My respects, O'' wise one.
- Bless you''

590
01:08:51,496 --> 01:08:52,815
l won''t accept alms from
a person in bindings.

591
01:08:55,496 --> 01:09:00,206
''And l can''t cross the line.
- Then, l''ll go away hungry''

592
01:09:00,296 --> 01:09:04,892
Wait! Nobody goes hungry
from Lord Rama''s door

593
01:09:09,665 --> 01:09:12,657
- Who are you? - You
will soon find out!

594
01:09:14,145 --> 01:09:18,058
''- Laxman, you left Sita alone?
- You only called out to me''

595
01:09:18,145 --> 01:09:20,943
That wasn''t my voice! There''s
something fishy in this

596
01:09:21,025 --> 01:09:22,094
Let''s go.
- Yes.

597
01:09:23,065 --> 01:09:24,134
Sita

598
01:09:35,945 --> 01:09:40,416
''Janaki isn''t here, Laxman
- Brother, l have my doubts''

599
01:09:41,945 --> 01:09:43,014
Look at this

600
01:09:46,705 --> 01:09:48,457
- Sita. . - Mother. .

601
01:09:48,705 --> 01:09:49,774
Sita. .

602
01:09:49,865 --> 01:09:50,934
Sita. .

603
01:09:52,385 --> 01:09:54,341
Sita. .

604
01:09:54,425 --> 01:09:58,577
''Sita. . ''

605
01:09:58,665 --> 01:10:05,059
''Sita, because they can''t see you. .

606
01:10:04,865 --> 01:10:11,213
. .two eyes are so very void today''

607
01:10:11,305 --> 01:10:16,060
''Sita. . My dear Sita. . ''

