01:10:18,065 --> 01:10:22,855
''O'' water, O'' dry lands. .
O'' directions. . ''

609
01:10:24,225 --> 01:10:29,538
''O'' woods and groves. .
O'' trees and creepers. . ''

610
01:10:30,505 --> 01:10:36,341
''Tell me the whereabouts
of my love. . ''

611
01:10:36,785 --> 01:10:42,303
-''Show me where
my beloved is hiding''

612
