and bid them goodbye''

648
01:15:20,594 --> 01:15:21,663
Sita.

649
01:15:24,114 --> 01:15:30,792
The whole world is sleeping
peacefully and you''re still awake?

650
01:15:32,354 --> 01:15:38,111
How can these eyes give in to sleep
when they''re dying to see Rama?

651
01:15:39,194 --> 01:15:44,791
''Sleep. . Even l can''t
sleep, Janaki''

652
01:15:45,794 --> 01:15:49,503
''A sinner like you, can
never sleep peacefully''

653
01:15:49,994 --> 01:15:53,066
''l''m not a sinner. l''m your
ardent lover, Sita''

654
01:15:53,554 --> 01:15:55,624
l can give you every
comfort available

655
01:15:56,626 --> 01:16:00,016
The happiness l got at the
feet of Lord Rama. .

656
01:16:00,106 --> 01:16:04,384
''. .can''t be compared to
any other joy, anywhere''

657
01:16:04,466 --> 01:16:06,741
Sita ! Ram is in exile!

658
01:16:08,049 --> 01:16:11,280
- He''s still my heartbeat. - l''m
the conqueror of the 3 worlds

659
01:16:11,969 --> 01:16:17,566
That''s why you abducted me l
suppose. You rascal ! A sinner. .

660
01:16:17,649 --> 01:16:22,439
''Sita ! You won''t give in, eh? Then,
l''ll force myself on you ! ''

661
01:16:22,529 --> 01:16:24,360
Ravana ! Ravana !

662
01:16:25,849 --> 01:16:30,320
Ravana, Forgotten my curse?
Remember. .

663
01:16:49,009 --> 01:16:52,285
''lf you don''t change your mind,
l''ll have my own way! ''

664
01:17:17,619 --> 01:17:21,851
But. . . . how did
this ring get here?

665
01:17:24,779 --> 01:17:27,339
''- Can it be that he. .
- Don''t worry, mother. ''

666
01:17:33,819 --> 01:17:36,811
''- Who are you? - Lord Rama''s
messenger, Hanuman''

667
01:17:37,779 --> 01:17:42,489
Lord Rama''s messenger? A monkey?

668
01:17:43,379 --> 01:17:46,098
This ring is it''s proof

669
01:17:52,987 --> 01:17:54,136
Dear husband. .

670
01:17:59,027 --> 01:18:00,904
''My husband. . He''s well, isn''t he?''

671
01:18:01,707 --> 01:18:02,776
Yes, M''lady''

672
01:18:03,147 --> 01:18:05,536
- And dear Laxman? - He too

673
01:18:06,307 --> 01:18:13,145
''Does my husband ever think
about me, Hanuman?''

674
01:18:13,493 --> 01:18:18,613
''M''Lady, if you''re missing
him so very much. . ''

675
01:18:18,693 --> 01:18:22,811
he''s missing you many times more!

676
01:18:22,893 --> 01:18:23,962
Dear Lord. .

677
01:18:24,053 --> 01:18:27,602
''Take courage, M''Lady. When
l go back to him. . ''

678
01:18:27,693 --> 01:18:31,845
. . Lord Rama''s Army of Apes
will attack this Lanka

679
01:18:32,333 --> 01:18:33,607
ln that army. .

680
01:18:37,365 --> 01:18:40,641
. .are all the monkeys like you?
- Yes M''Lady

681
